CONTEXT ImportBootstrap IN ENGLISH
-- Minimal model to exercise import-bootstrap mode (DesignChoices OK-09). The TOT
-- invariant "every Person has a Name" can be violated mid-way by a deferred import
-- (a Person without a Name) and satisfied at the end, so "Start checking" can go
-- red and then green.

CONCEPT Person "A person"
CONCEPT Name "A person's name"

RELATION name[Person*Name] [UNI,TOT]
MEANING "Every person has exactly one name. TOT makes this an invariant."

INTERFACE Persons : V[SESSION*Person] cRud BOX
  [ "name" : name cRUd
  ]

ENDCONTEXT
